# Oracle: settle run/mc_param (VACASK 36be560: `mc m1 samples=k` with `parameters k=2` is
# "Variable or constant 'k' not defined.", exit 1; a `var` runs, mc_var): an mc argument
# reading a parameter is invalid in source, P2316, the line refused as an unmatched `mc` is,
# so the `endmc` is refused too (P2320) and the analysis is read as written.
# codes: P2316 P2320 S0004 S0004
file "mc_param.sim" deck
  title "an mc sample count from a parameter"
  param k = 2i
  opaque vacask invalid "mc m1 samples=k"
  analysis op name=op1
  opaque vacask invalid "endmc"
